### =====================================================================
### La Carta API · pruebas rápidas
### VS Code: instala la extensión "REST Client" y dale "Send Request" a cada bloque.
### (También puedes probar todo desde Swagger: http://localhost:3000/docs)
### =====================================================================
@api = http://localhost:3000

### 1) Login SUPER ADMIN  -> copia accessToken en @superToken
# @name superLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "superadmin@lacarta.app", "password": "CambiaEsto123" }

###
@superToken = {{superLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2) Super admin: listar empresas (con conteos)
GET {{api}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### 3) Super admin: crear empresa + su primer admin
# @name newCompany
POST {{api}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pizzería Don Tito",
  "slug": "don_tito",
  "whatsappPhone": "573009876543",
  "address": "Calle 16 # 12-30, Valledupar",
  "admin": { "email": "admin@dontito.com", "password": "DonTito2026", "fullName": "Tito" }
}

###
@titoId = {{newCompany.response.body.company.id}}

### 4) Login ADMIN de Burger House (creado por el seed)
# @name burgerLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@burgerhouse.com", "password": "Admin12345" }

###
@burgerToken = {{burgerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@burgerId = {{burgerLogin.response.body.user.companyId}}

### 5) Admin Burger: su menú (categorías)
GET {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}

### 6) Admin Burger intenta ver la empresa de Don Tito -> debe dar 403
GET {{api}}/companies/{{titoId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}

### 7) Admin Burger intenta listar todas las empresas -> 403 (solo super admin)
GET {{api}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}

### 8) Admin Burger: crear categoría
# @name newCat
POST {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Perros calientes", "sortOrder": 2 }

### 9) Admin Burger: crear producto con extras
POST {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Perro especial",
  "description": "Salchicha americana, papita, queso y salsas",
  "basePrice": 15000,
  "categoryId": "{{newCat.response.body.id}}",
  "extraGroups": [
    {
      "title": "Salsas",
      "isRequired": false,
      "minSelection": 0,
      "maxSelection": 3,
      "options": [
        { "name": "Piña", "price": 0 },
        { "name": "Tártara", "price": 0 },
        { "name": "Queso fundido", "price": 2500 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 10) Admin Burger: horario (1 = lunes ... 7 = domingo)
PUT {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/hours
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hours": [
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "openTime": "11:00", "closeTime": "22:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 2, "openTime": "11:00", "closeTime": "22:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 3, "openTime": "00:00", "closeTime": "00:00", "closed": true },
    { "dayOfWeek": 4, "openTime": "11:00", "closeTime": "22:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 5, "openTime": "12:00", "closeTime": "02:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 6, "openTime": "12:00", "closeTime": "02:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 7, "openTime": "12:00", "closeTime": "22:00", "closed": false }
  ]
}

### 11) PÚBLICO (sin token): menú completo por slug
# @name menu
GET {{api}}/public/burger_house/menu

### 12) PÚBLICO: crear pedido (el servidor calcula precios)
# Cambia los ids por los que te devolvió el menú (producto "Hamburguesa clásica",
# opción "Tres cuartos" del grupo obligatorio y "Tocineta" de Adiciones).
POST {{api}}/public/burger_house/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "delivery",
  "customerName": "Luis",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "address": "Calle 10 # 5-20",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PEGA_AQUI_ID_PRODUCTO",
      "quantity": 2,
      "comment": "Sin cebolla",
      "extras": [
        { "optionId": "PEGA_AQUI_ID_TRES_CUARTOS" },
        { "optionId": "PEGA_AQUI_ID_TOCINETA" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 13) Admin Burger: pedidos pendientes
GET {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/orders?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}

### 14) Admin Burger: cambiar estado del pedido
PATCH {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}/orders/PEGA_AQUI_ID_PEDIDO/status
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "preparing" }

### 15) Super admin: suspender Don Tito (su menú deja de verse y su admin no puede entrar)
PATCH {{api}}/companies/{{titoId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### 16) Público: el menú de una empresa suspendida -> 404
GET {{api}}/public/don_tito/menu

### =====================================================================
### PAGOS (sin pasarela)
### =====================================================================

### 17) Admin Burger: configurar métodos de pago
PATCH {{api}}/companies/{{burgerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{burgerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acceptsCash": true,
  "acceptsTransfer": true,
  "breBKey": "@burgerhouse",
  "paymentHolder": "Burger House SAS",
  "paymentNotes": "Envía la captura del pago para confirmar tu pedido"
}

### 18) Público: pedido por transferencia -> devuelve proofToken
# @name transferOrder
POST {{api}}/public/burger_house/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "takeaway",
  "customerName": "Luis",
  "paymentMethod": "transfer",
  "items": [ { "productId": "PEGA_AQUI_ID_PRODUCTO_SIN_EXTRAS", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 19) Público: subir comprobante (cambia la ruta de la imagen por una tuya)
POST {{api}}/public/burger_house/orders/{{transferOrder.response.body.order.id}}/proof
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----LaCarta

------LaCarta
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="token"

{{transferOrder.response.body.proofToken}}
------LaCarta
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="comprobante.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./comprobante.png
------LaCarta--
